2026-10-20T21:06:14.1699292Z                 '## References\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1699889Z +               '* Portswigger: [Server-Side Template Injection](https://portswigger.net/web-security/server-side-template-injection).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1700303Z +               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-74](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/74.html).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1700493Z +             text: '# Server Side Template Injection\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1701447Z +               'A template from a server templating engine such as Jinja constructed from user input can allow the user to execute arbitrary code using certain template features. It can also allow for cross-site scripting.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1702072Z -               '* OWASP: [Regular expression Denial of Service - ReDoS](https://www.owasp.org/index.php/Regular_expression_Denial_of_Service_-_ReDoS).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1702363Z -               '* Wikipedia: [ReDoS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ReDoS).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1702672Z -               '* Python docs: [re](https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1703141Z -               '* SonarSource: [RSPEC-2631](https://rules.sonarsource.com/python/type/Vulnerability/RSPEC-2631).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1703554Z -               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-730](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/730.html).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1704232Z -               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-400](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/400.html).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1704578Z -             text: '# Regular expression injection\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1706063Z -               'Constructing a regular expression with unsanitized user input is dangerous as a malicious user may be able to modify the meaning of the expression. In particular, such a user may be able to provide a regular expression fragment that takes exponential time in the worst case, and use that to perform a Denial of Service attack.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1706158Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1706243Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1706363Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1707555Z +               'Ensure that an untrusted value is not used to directly construct a template. Jinja also provides `SandboxedEnvironment` that prohibits access to unsafe methods and attributes. This can be used if constructing a template from user input is absolutely necessary.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1708457Z -               "Before embedding user input into a regular expression, use a sanitization function such as `re.escape` to escape meta-characters that have a special meaning regarding regular expressions' syntax.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1708543Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1708800Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1708917Z                 '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1709455Z +               'In the following case, `template` is used to generate a Jinja2 template string. This can lead to remote code execution.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1709801Z -               'The following examples are based on a simple Flask web server environment.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1709887Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1710489Z -               'The following example shows a HTTP request parameter that is used to construct a regular expression without sanitizing it first:\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1710576Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1710705Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1710880Z +               'from django.urls import path\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711081Z +               'from django.http import HttpResponse\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711270Z +               'from jinja2 import Template, escape\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711352Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711451Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711595Z +               'def a(request):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711786Z +               "    template = request.GET['template']\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1711881Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712115Z +               '    # BAD: Template is constructed from user input. \n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712278Z +               '    t = Template(template)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712373Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712537Z +               "    name = request.GET['name']\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712729Z +               '    html = t.render(name=escape(name))\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712899Z +               '    return HttpResponse(html)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1712988Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1713086Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1713218Z +               'urlpatterns = [\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1713355Z +               "    path('a', a),\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1713456Z +               ']\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1713554Z +               '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1714321Z +               'The following is an example of a string that could be used to cause remote code execution when interpreted as a template:\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1714423Z +               '\n' +
