2026-10-20T21:06:14.1883100Z +               '    search_filter = "(user={})".format(unsafe_filter)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1883198Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1883396Z +               "    srv = ldap3.Server('ldap://127.0.0.1')\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1883647Z +               '    conn = ldap3.Connection(srv, user=dn, auto_bind=True)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1884038Z +               '    conn.search(dn, search_filter)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1884138Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1884233Z                 '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1885107Z +               'In the third and fourth example, the input provided by the user is sanitized before it is included in the search filter or DN. This ensures the meaning of the query cannot be changed by a malicious user.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1885194Z                 '\n' +
