2026-10-20T21:06:14.1986499Z -               ']\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1986584Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1986826Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1986954Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1987140Z +               "not_sensitive_data = {'a': 1, 'b': 2}\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1987378Z +               '# GOOD: it is fine to log data that is not sensitive\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.1987648Z +               'print(f"[INFO] Some object contains: {not_sensitive_data}")\n' +
