2026-10-20T21:06:14.2100956Z +             text: '# NoSQL Injection\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2102752Z +               'Passing user-controlled sources into NoSQL queries can result in a NoSQL injection flaw. This tainted NoSQL query containing a user-controlled source can then execute a malicious query in a NoSQL database such as MongoDB. In order for the user-controlled source to taint the NoSQL query, the user-controller source must be converted into a Python object using something like `json.loads` or `xmltodict.parse`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2103361Z -               '* OWASP: [Insertion of Sensitive Information into Log File](https://owasp.org/Top10/A09_2021-Security_Logging_and_Monitoring_Failures/).\n' +
