2026-10-20T21:06:14.2130819Z +             text: 'Cookies without the `HttpOnly` attribute set can be accessed by JS scripts, making them more vulnerable to XSS attacks.'
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2130904Z +           },
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2131002Z +           help: {
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2131271Z +             markdown: '# Sensitive cookie missing `HttpOnly` attribute\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2132635Z +               'Cookies without the `HttpOnly` flag set are accessible to JavaScript running in the same origin. In case of a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability, the cookie can be stolen by a malicious script. If a sensitive cookie does not need to be accessed directly by client-side JS, the `HttpOnly` flag should be set.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2132735Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2132953Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2133095Z +               '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2133695Z +               "Set `httponly` to `True`, or add `; HttpOnly;` to the cookie's raw header value, to ensure that the cookie is not accessible via JavaScript.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2133998Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2134140Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2134276Z +               '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2134881Z +               'In the following examples, the cases marked GOOD show secure cookie attributes being set; whereas in the case marked BAD they are not set.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2134978Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135074Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135194Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135466Z +               'from flask import Flask, request, make_response, Response\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135557Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135661Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135816Z +               '@app.route("/good1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2135945Z +               'def good1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2136111Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2136677Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", secure=True, httponly=True, samesite='Strict') # GOOD: Attributes are securely set\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2136808Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2136912Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2137008Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2137150Z +               '@app.route("/good2")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2137283Z +               'def good2():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2137436Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2137977Z +               `    resp.headers['Set-Cookie'] = "sessionid=value; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict" # GOOD: Attributes are securely set \n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2138114Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2138209Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2138352Z +               '@app.route("/bad1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2138480Z +               'def bad1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2138632Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2139403Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", samesite='None') # BAD: the SameSite attribute is set to 'None' and the 'Secure' and 'HttpOnly' attributes are set to False by default.\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2139538Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2139630Z +               '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2139726Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2139852Z +               '## References\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2140588Z +               '* PortSwigger: [Cookie without HttpOnly flag set](https://portswigger.net/kb/issues/00500600_cookie-without-httponly-flag-set)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2141013Z +               '* MDN: [Set-Cookie](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Set-Cookie).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2141424Z +               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-1004](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1004.html).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2141674Z +             text: '# Sensitive cookie missing `HttpOnly` attribute\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2143028Z +               'Cookies without the `HttpOnly` flag set are accessible to JavaScript running in the same origin. In case of a Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability, the cookie can be stolen by a malicious script. If a sensitive cookie does not need to be accessed directly by client-side JS, the `HttpOnly` flag should be set.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2143126Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2143214Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2143354Z +               '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2144171Z +               "Set `httponly` to `True`, or add `; HttpOnly;` to the cookie's raw header value, to ensure that the cookie is not accessible via JavaScript.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2144433Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2144530Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2144655Z +               '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145275Z +               'In the following examples, the cases marked GOOD show secure cookie attributes being set; whereas in the case marked BAD they are not set.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145371Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145459Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145584Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145849Z +               'from flask import Flask, request, make_response, Response\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2145942Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2146036Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2146180Z +               '@app.route("/good1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2146315Z +               'def good1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2146476Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147037Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", secure=True, httponly=True, samesite='Strict') # GOOD: Attributes are securely set\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147176Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147274Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147367Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147520Z +               '@app.route("/good2")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147649Z +               'def good2():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2147798Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148329Z +               `    resp.headers['Set-Cookie'] = "sessionid=value; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict" # GOOD: Attributes are securely set \n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148468Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148560Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148711Z +               '@app.route("/bad1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148833Z +               'def bad1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2148992Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2149765Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", samesite='None') # BAD: the SameSite attribute is set to 'None' and the 'Secure' and 'HttpOnly' attributes are set to False by default.\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2149894Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2149996Z +               '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2150123Z +               '\n' +
