2026-10-20T21:06:14.2204318Z +             text: 'Cookies with `SameSite` set to `None` can allow for Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) attacks.'
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2204402Z +           },
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2204498Z +           help: {
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2204797Z +             markdown: '# Sensitive cookie with `SameSite` attribute set to `None`\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2206016Z +               "Cookies with the `SameSite` attribute set to `'None'` will be sent with cross-origin requests. This can sometimes allow for Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) attacks, in which a third-party site could perform actions on behalf of a user, if the cookie is used for authentication.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2206115Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2206203Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2206345Z +               '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2207027Z +               "Set the `samesite` to `Lax` or `Strict`, or add `; SameSite=Lax;`, or `; SameSite=Strict;` to the cookie's raw header value. The default value in most cases is `Lax`.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2207116Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2207210Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2207330Z +               '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2207937Z +               'In the following examples, the cases marked GOOD show secure cookie attributes being set; whereas in the case marked BAD they are not set.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208177Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208273Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208398Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208662Z +               'from flask import Flask, request, make_response, Response\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208755Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208847Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2208996Z +               '@app.route("/good1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2209125Z +               'def good1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2209286Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2209841Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", secure=True, httponly=True, samesite='Strict') # GOOD: Attributes are securely set\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2209977Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2210072Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2210159Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2210308Z +               '@app.route("/good2")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2210441Z +               'def good2():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2210593Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211125Z +               `    resp.headers['Set-Cookie'] = "sessionid=value; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict" # GOOD: Attributes are securely set \n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211435Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211525Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211668Z +               '@app.route("/bad1")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211792Z +               'def bad1():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2211949Z +               '    resp = make_response()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2212722Z +               `    resp.set_cookie("sessionid", value="value", samesite='None') # BAD: the SameSite attribute is set to 'None' and the 'Secure' and 'HttpOnly' attributes are set to False by default.\n` +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2212852Z +               '    return resp\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2212954Z +               '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2213048Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2213176Z +               '## References\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2213590Z +               '* MDN: [Set-Cookie](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Set-Cookie).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2214110Z +               '* OWASP: [SameSite](https://owasp.org/www-community/SameSite).\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2214529Z +               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-1275](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1275.html).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2214811Z +             text: '# Sensitive cookie with `SameSite` attribute set to `None`\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2216027Z +               "Cookies with the `SameSite` attribute set to `'None'` will be sent with cross-origin requests. This can sometimes allow for Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) attacks, in which a third-party site could perform actions on behalf of a user, if the cookie is used for authentication.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2216119Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2216217Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2216364Z +               '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2217041Z +               "Set the `samesite` to `Lax` or `Strict`, or add `; SameSite=Lax;`, or `; SameSite=Strict;` to the cookie's raw header value. The default value in most cases is `Lax`.\n" +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2217138Z +               '\n' +
