2026-10-20T21:06:14.2229354Z +             text: 'URL redirection based on unvalidated user input may cause redirection to malicious web sites.'
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2229916Z -             text: 'Binding a socket to all interfaces opens it up to traffic from any IPv4 address and is therefore associated with security risks.'
