2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601095Z -               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601227Z -               'import ssl\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601318Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601514Z -               '# Using flags to restrict the protocol\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601679Z -               'context = ssl.SSLContext()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2601931Z -               'context.options |= ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1 | ssl.OP_NO_TLSv1_1\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602026Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602276Z -               '# Declaring a minimum version to restrict the protocol\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602467Z -               'context = ssl.create_default_context()\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602704Z -               'context.minimum_version = ssl.TLSVersion.TLSv1_2\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602799Z -               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2602898Z -               '```\n' +
