2026-10-20T21:06:14.2638941Z +               "It's easy to write a regular expression range that matches a wider range of characters than you intended. For example, `/[a-zA-z]/` matches all lowercase and all uppercase letters, as you would expect, but it also matches the characters: `` [ \\ ] ^ _ ` ``.\n" +
