2026-10-20T21:06:14.2829149Z +           help: {
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2829354Z +             markdown: '# Inefficient regular expression\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2831111Z +               'Some regular expressions take a long time to match certain input strings to the point where the time it takes to match a string of length *n* is proportional to *n<sup>k</sup>* or even *2<sup>n</sup>*. Such regular expressions can negatively affect performance, or even allow a malicious user to perform a Denial of Service ("DoS") attack by crafting an expensive input string for the regular expression to match.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2831460Z -               '* OWASP: [SSRF](https://www.owasp.org/index.php/Server_Side_Request_Forgery)\n' +
