2026-10-20T21:06:14.2923210Z +               'Instead, the request parameter should be sanitized first, for example using the function `re.escape`. This ensures that the user cannot insert characters which have a special meaning in regular expressions.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.2924400Z -               'The `unsafe` check is easy to bypass because the unescaped `.` allows for any character before `example.com`, effectively allowing the redirect to go to an attacker-controlled domain such as `wwwXexample.com`.\n' +
