2026-10-20T21:06:14.3235024Z -               'In a good example, the program uses the `replace` function to provide parameter processing to the user, and replace `\\r\\n` and `\\n` with empty characters. To a certain extent, the occurrence of log injection vulnerabilities is reduced.\n' +
