2026-10-20T21:06:14.3507143Z +             id: 'py/comparison-missing-self',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3507856Z -             description: 'Using the iteration variable of a list comprehension in the enclosing scope will result in different behavior between Python 2 and 3 and is confusing.',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3508032Z -             id: 'py/leaking-list-comprehension',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3508146Z               kind: 'problem',
