2026-10-20T21:06:14.3988225Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3988316Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3988428Z                 '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3988559Z +               'import re\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3988758Z +               'matcher = re.compile(r"[password|pwd]")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989053Z -               'import sys\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989142Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989297Z +               'def find_password(data):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989465Z +               '    if matcher.match(data):\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989631Z +               '        print("Found password!")\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989759Z -               'def main():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3989944Z -               '    sys.stdout.write("Hello World!")\n' +
