2026-10-20T21:06:14.3990111Z                 '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3990549Z +               'To fix this problem, the regular expression should be rewritten to `r"(password|pwd)"`.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3990634Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.3990729Z +               '\n' +
