2026-10-20T21:06:14.4000506Z +             markdown: '# Wrong number of arguments for format\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4001384Z +               'A formatting expression, that is an expression of the format `fmt % arguments` must have the correct number of arguments on the right hand side of the expression. Otherwise, a `TypeError` will be raised.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4001550Z -             markdown: '# Unused import\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4002336Z -               'A module is imported (using the `import` statement) but that module is never used. This creates a dependency that does not need to exist and makes the code more difficult to read.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4002422Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4002508Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4002633Z                 '## Recommendation\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4003175Z +               'Change the format to match the arguments and ensure that the right hand argument always has the correct number of elements.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4003343Z -               'Delete the import statement.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4003423Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4003506Z                 '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4003633Z +               '## Example\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4004452Z +               'In the following example the right hand side of the formatting operation can be of length 2, which does not match the format string.\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4004555Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4004650Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4004771Z +               '```python\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4004922Z +               'def unsafe_format():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005086Z +               '    if unlikely_condition():\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005229Z +               '        args = (1,2)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005352Z +               '    else:\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005496Z +               '        args = (1, 2, 3)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005654Z +               '    return "%s %s %s" % args\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005750Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005843Z +               '```\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4005938Z +               '\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4006053Z                 '## References\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4006707Z +               '* Python Library Reference: [String Formatting.](http://docs.python.org/library/stdtypes.html#string-formatting)\n' +
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4007121Z +               '* Common Weakness Enumeration: [CWE-685](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/685.html).\n',
2026-10-20T21:06:14.4007335Z +             text: '# Wrong number of arguments for format\n' +
